  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU progressive Platforms for Climate Action</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A new phase of the UNDP Funded EU Progressive Platforms program CAI01-E1 has been lauched by the UNDP.An Expression ofInterest and Budget have been developed, attached here for review and approval to submit to UNDP May 2 or latest May 3 AM CET. The budget ceiling is USD 200K. It has been agreed with the donor to submit a simplified budget at this stage to be further refined through a workplanning process in June.The program has 2 outcomes: 1) Support to the LDC Chair and Membres in UNFCCC processes; 2) Capacity building in LDCS on NDC implementation.</narrative>
  </description>
